<p class="eyebrow">CyberAlchemy Lab / Open source</p>
<h1 id="hero-title">An open company brain</h1>
<p class="hero-deck">Organize your company’s knowledge and work, so people and AI agents share the context behind each decision.</p>
<p class="hero-support">For software work, <a href="#craft">Craft</a> makes concepts, rules and behavior explicit, giving implementation a model to work from.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><a class="ds-button" href="start-here.html">Explore the Lab <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#craft">Meet Craft <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
